Assignment 13 consisted of implementing a ProgressView. function flip card inside Model (MemoryGame) was modified with additional logic for 
flipping cards and keeping track of progress. Also function reset was created inside the Model (MemoryGame) to flip all cards back down and 
reset the progress indicator. Inside ViewModel (MemoryGameStore) variable numberofpairs, function reset, and variable progress were added. Inside the
View (ContentView) inside the struct ContentView ProgressView was added and a button was added when selected initiates the reset function.

